---
description: Flutter app rules
globs: ["Frontend/sheikh-driver/**/*.dart"]
alwaysApply: false
---

API base URL from build flavour or remote config, never a hardcoded IP.
Offline-first: queue writes in Hive, reconcile on reconnect, show what is pending.
Telemetry carries Live / Stale / Offline states; a cached speed is never shown as current.
Tenant comes from the token, never from a parameter the client sets.
Never log or cache CNIC or exact coordinates to disk.
